##### Step 9: Integration Testing with Sandbox API

Test adapter against third-party vendor's sandbox environment validating request/response transformation.

**Integration Test** (`FirstDatabankAdapterIntegrationTests.cs`):

```csharp
using Gainwell.Pharmacy.Adapters;
using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions;
using Xunit;

[Collection("Integration")]
public class FirstDatabankAdapterIntegrationTests
{
    [Fact]
    public async Task GetDrugInteractions_RealFdbSandbox_ReturnsInteractionsAsync()
    {
        // Arrange - use FDB sandbox environment
        var httpClient = new HttpClient { BaseAddress = new Uri("https://sandbox-api.fdb.com") };
